mutation introduce a token phase outside the agreed protocol
detects TypeOK
only cold
- pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![w] = "queued"]
+ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![w] = "queue_typo"]

mutation remove signer serialization for competing token refreshes
detects ExclusiveSigner
only cold
- pc[w] = "queued" /\ lock = 0
+ pc[w] = "queued"

mutation create new VAPID keys instead of retrieving the stable stored keys
detects PersistentIdentity
only warm
- IF keys = 0 THEN latestKey + 1 ELSE keys
+ latestKey + 1

mutation lose the last cached header on a signer restart
detects DurableAcrossRestart
only warm
- /\ UNCHANGED <<now, durable, lock, caller>>
+ /\ cache' = None
+ /\ UNCHANGED <<now, keys, latestKey, lastPersisted, published, gapOK, lock, caller>>

mutation replace a valid header at the first hour
detects MinimumRefreshGap
only warm
- IF CanReuse(cache, now)
+ IF cache.id # 0 /\ cache.refreshAt > now + 1

mutation reuse the last header on or after the refresh boundary
detects RefreshDecisions
only warm
- IF CanReuse(cache, now)
+ IF cache.id # 0 /\ cache.refreshAt >= now

mutation return a minted header before its storage write
detects ReturnedAfterCommit
only cold
- lock = w /\ pc[w] = "committed"
+ lock = w /\ pc[w] \in {"staged", "committed"}

mutation increase the generated token lifetime past Apple's limit
detects HeaderLifetime
only cold
- FreshHeader(generation, keyId, time) == Token(generation, keyId, time)
+ FreshHeader(generation, keyId, time) == [Token(generation, keyId, time) EXCEPT !.expires = time + 25]

mutation overwrite the shared Authorization header with a new per-device token at send
detects UsesSharedHeader
only cold
- [sent EXCEPT ![w] = returned[w]]
+ [sent EXCEPT ![w] = FreshHeader(returned[w].id + 1, obtainedKey[w], now)]

mutation fail to release the signer when returning to a caller
detects RequestFinishes
only cold
- /\ lock' = 0 /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![w] = "send"]
+ /\ UNCHANGED lock /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![w] = "send"]
